# Absolute origin of the elfagent API.
#
# Leave unset for local development — Vite proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8077, so
# the SSE endpoint is same-origin (EventSource is stricter about CORS than
# fetch, and a live view that works in tests but not the browser is a poor
# thing to discover late).
#
# In a Netlify build this MUST be set to the deployed API's origin, and that
# origin must appear in the API's CORS allow-list.
VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api-host.example.com
